{
  "why": "The link walk (WORKLIST P4.21; the variant 'links' in e2e/variants.json, planned by e2e/walk-routes.mjs): every address of e2e/routes.json opened by a stranger, by a bad id and warm, each waiting for what that screen must say. `doors`: the routes only a member may open, each drawn for a stranger as the way in (its control's id); the walk taps it, signs in from the form it opens, and must land on the route itself, never the Lobby. `gone`: each route that takes an id, opened with an id of another shape (`malformed`) and with one of its shape that names nothing (`missing`), each with the words its screen says then, never an empty page or 'could not reach'. walkRoutes.test.ts holds this to the routes and each word to its screen's source.",
  "doors": {
    "app/(tabs)/profile.tsx": "profile-sign-in-prompt",
    "app/settings.tsx": "members-only-sign-in",
    "app/edit-profile.tsx": "members-only-sign-in",
    "app/year-in-cinema.tsx": "members-only-sign-in",
    "app/lounge/[id].tsx": "members-only-sign-in",
    "app/(modals)/notifications-modal.tsx": "members-only-sign-in",
    "app/(modals)/list-modal.tsx": "members-only-sign-in",
    "app/(modals)/cover-picker.tsx": "members-only-sign-in",
    "app/dispatch/compose.tsx": "members-only-sign-in"
  },
  "gone": {
